{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Gore is a physics-based horror cooking simulator.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/c5e1ffe81c10c98754d8d890ddef7b9e.poster.avif?t=1761477642\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/c5e1ffe81c10c98754d8d890ddef7b9e.webm?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/c5e1ffe81c10c98754d8d890ddef7b9e.mp4?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based cooking</strong>: Juggle ingredients, flip food to cook all sides, and manage chaotic kitchen dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense and unnerving atmosphere</strong>: Creepy tone with occasional goofyness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Perspectives:</strong>\u00a0A story mode and the hardcore mode that brings a new perspective to the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless survival mode</strong>: Test your endurance and mastery under constantly building pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/6f63ebe54d1b5e2e372580b211d29925.poster.avif?t=1761477642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/6f63ebe54d1b5e2e372580b211d29925.webm?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/6f63ebe54d1b5e2e372580b211d29925.mp4?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kitchen Gore you voluntarily feed a monster in your basement. The ingredients are various and require different approaches to be cooked. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While doing this you also have to periodically scroll the phone to keep her(?) distracted. If things go wrong and you get her angry, play the music box to calm her down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/6472771ecdd4fa17c9c321e1874be36a.poster.avif?t=1761477642\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/6472771ecdd4fa17c9c321e1874be36a.webm?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/6472771ecdd4fa17c9c321e1874be36a.mp4?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you and why are you voluntarily keeping and feeding a monster in your basement? Each level in story and hardcore mode begins with cryptic text that unravels more about your character and the situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore mode introduces new story content that recontextualizes the original narrative from story mode as well as a different ending scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/8fa96210ebe558f0ebcfcff3cbc7239a.webp?t=1761477642\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/8fa96210ebe558f0ebcfcff3cbc7239a.poster.avif?t=1761477642\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=190 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing the game with headphones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy :)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"letting go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/892b0c32a49f83fac7d16c7eabad25945d550b40.jpg"},{"name":"be let go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/6be86f6758557d506b2ce792209f04fe7afed2c7.jpg"},{"name":"getting warmed up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/ba9e45f137cf63dd4398cc5970f8b1abca89da58.jpg"},{"name":"alright, not bad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/c259e652d3c73b8fa51a60b1d58fe41d8b4143d5.jpg"},{"name":"master chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/02e54be57808cec1bc8b47cb7af08bb9bbba2fec.jpg"},{"name":"cat got your...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/294478180ceafa709f059e70e5f0cf72e14ac86c.jpg"},{"name":"children these days","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/87119fb2e8cc39b9bed3d8841f79bbfe590c6c4f.jpg"},{"name":"breakfast stands for breaking a fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/e3d19b191625946c6fd52a195766542244712f03.jpg"},{"name":"could've made it 69","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/8a221e83c81fcf4ee512a2c302f5e9a24c5e5e91.jpg"},{"name":"THEY JUMP!?!??!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833100/0f6e7e8a0423b3bb7fd24bd94d4d1c6606003a09.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833100?t=1761477642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati