4be36a.mp4?t=1761477642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you and why are you voluntarily keeping and feeding a monster in your basement? Each level in story and hardcore mode begins with cryptic text that unravels more about your character and the situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore mode introduces new story content that recontextualizes the original narrative from story mode as well as a different ending scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/8fa96210ebe558f0ebcfcff3cbc7239a.webp?t=1761477642\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/extras/8fa96210ebe558f0ebcfcff3cbc7239a.poster.avif?t=1761477642\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=190 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing the game with headphones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy :)</p>","developers":["xoblins"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833100/5ac7eaa0b7332bbffa951f16525615c143283662/header.jpg?t=1761477642","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833100/498891197/75c10f5b5a4814e0513512c0446e4a6556f9e35a/1753381360/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753384689","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833100/498891197/75c10f5b5a4814e0513512c0446e4a6556f9e35a/1753381360/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753384689","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833100/498891197/75c10f5b5a4814e0513512c0446e4a6556f9e35a/1753381360/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753384689","id":257173517,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25717351